    <string name="tutorial_intro">Welcome! Your goal is to move all your checkers around the board and bear them off before your opponent. Let\'s practice each skill!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_setup">This is the starting position. Your orange checkers move toward your home board (bottom-right). Let\'s roll!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_roll">Tap the dice button to roll — or shake your phone! Each die lets you move one checker by that many points.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_move">Now drag one of your checkers to a green-highlighted destination. Tap a checker to see where it can go.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_hit">See that lone white checker? Move your checker onto it to hit it! A single opponent checker is vulnerable.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_bar">Your checker is on the bar. You must re-enter it onto the board before moving any other checker. Roll and enter!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_bear_off">All your checkers are in your home board! Now bear them off by rolling and moving past position 24. Bear off to win!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_finished">Excellent! You\'ve mastered the basics. Enjoy playing for real!</string>

